	(text "Rails: VSYS (batt/USB), +1V8 = nPM1300 BUCK1 (VSET1 47k), VDD_SNS = LOADSW1-gated\n1.8V sensor rail.  BUCK2 unused per nPM1300 PS Config 2: VOUT2 tied to VSYS\n(expected ERC power-output tie), SW2/PVSS2/VINLDO2 grounded, LSOUT2/VOUTLDO2 n/c.\nnRF52840 per PS v1.11 sec 7.3.5 Config 5: VDDH shorted to VDD (+1V8), REG1 DC/DC\n(DCC-15nH-10uH-DEC4/6), USB on, NFC off, no 32.768kHz crystal (use LFRC in fw).\nRF: ANT - 0.8pF/4.7nH/0.5pF match - RF_ANT net -> printed antenna (layout, tune\nvalues; PS notes C22-equivalent tuning pad omitted).  32MHz XTAL CL=8pF, 12pF loads;\n3225 fp placed, Nordic BOM suggests 2016 - crystal part TBD.\nStill TBD: USB connector (USB_DP/USB_DM/VBUS_IN/USB_CC1/USB_CC2), antenna geometry."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
